IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0039.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FRD0039C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 HOLD-FLAG          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 HOLD-ON-HOLD VALUE 'Y'.
    05 REVIEW-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 REVIEW-REVIEW-NEEDED VALUE 'Y'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CHECK-CHANNEL
    DISPLAY "HOLD-FLAG=" HOLD-FLAG
    DISPLAY "REVIEW-FLAG=" REVIEW-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-CHANNEL.
    IF CHANNEL-ONLINE
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN CARD-PRESENT = 'N' AND TXN-AMT > 1250
                SET HOLD-ON-HOLD TO TRUE
                MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
            WHEN TXN-AMT > 5000
                SET REVIEW-REVIEW-NEEDED TO TRUE
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO HOLD-FLAG
    END-IF.
